msgid "Schema.org Article"
msgstr "Artykuł Schema.org"

msgid "Adds Schema.org/Article to the JSON LD array. Creates Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle or APIReference."
msgstr "Dodaje ścieżkę Schema.org/Article do tablicy JSON LD. Tworzy obiekty Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle lub APIReference."

